# ---- Environment & secrets ----
# Root .env is DELIBERATELY tracked in this repo — see the note in docs/12_SESSION_CONTEXT.md.
# It is the ONLY env file: backend/src/app/core/settings.py reads it by
# absolute path, so a per-app backend/.env copy is neither needed nor tracked.
# This is an informed exception, not the default: normally an env file with real
# credentials never belongs in git, doubly so in a public repo. Made here so every
# teammate and the evaluator get a working shared-database connection on clone,
# for the duration of this event only.
backend/.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.key
*.pem

# ---- Python / backend ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ---- Node / frontend ----
node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
build/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# ---- Runtime data ----
logs/
*.log
.trash/

# ---- IDE / OS ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- AI assistant local state ----
# Skills are installed per-developer from upstream, never vendored here: they
# are third-party content we don't own the right to redistribute, and at least
# one (tailwind-4-docs) ships a snapshot its own author marks source-available
# but not open-source. Install instructions live in docs/11_AI_TOOLING.md.
.claude/

# ---- Merge artefacts ----
# A stray .orig/.rej committed during a conflict is how a half-resolved merge
# reaches main. See docs/10_LESSONS.md §1.
*.orig
*.rej

# ---- Working docs ----
# `docs/` and `ai_guidelines/` are deliberately TRACKED, not ignored. The
# virtual round ignored them, and two committed READMEs then linked to files
# that did not exist in a fresh clone (docs/10_LESSONS.md §11). Tracking them
# keeps every link in this repo resolvable and gives each teammate the
# playbook and working docs straight from a clone.
#
# Session chatter still stays out — notes, scratch files and one-off reports
# are not documents, and do not belong in the submission.
*_SESSION_NOTES.md
scratch/
